            <span class="l-en">Risk building</span><span class="l-zh">风险升温</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wnx-state">{% if _wnx_rtop %}<span class="l-en">Risk {{ _wnx_rtop }}</span><span class="l-zh">风险 {{ _wnx_rtop }}</span>{% else %}<span class="l-en">Risk radar loud</span><span class="l-zh">风险雷达偏响</span>{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="wnx-line"><span class="l-en">See exactly what would make it worse</span><span class="l-zh">看清什么会让它恶化</span></div>
          <span class="wnx-go"><span class="l-en">Open risk radar</span><span class="l-zh">打开风险雷达</span> &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        {% elif _wnx_ign %}
        <a class="wnx-card" style="--wnx-c:var(--isle-brief)" href="#dlg-ignition" onclick="event.preventDefault();mx5OpenDlg('dlg-ignition');">
