          <div class="wnx-line"><span class="l-en">Track whether early strength is real</span><span class="l-zh">跟踪初步转强是否成立</span></div>
          <span class="wnx-go"><span class="l-en">Open upturn signs</span><span class="l-zh">打开转强迹象</span> &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        {% else %}
