            <th data-tip-en="The validated MACD-2D × StochRSI-3D confluence buy gate (engine/signal_gate): Buy zone = both crossed within ~6 days, still constructive; About to cross = 3D StochRSI crossed, 2D MACD imminent. The board requires this." data-tip-zh="经验证的共振买入门控：买入区=两者约近6日内交叉且建设性；即将交叉=3日StochRSI已上穿、2日MACD即将交叉。榜单以此为准。">{{ t('buy', '买入') }}</th>
            <th>{{ t('cycle', '周期') }}</th><th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}</th>
            <th class="r" data-tip-en="Cross-sectional factor composite (value / quality / low-vol …) — a LIGHT quality tiebreaker (crowded, post-publication decayed), not a driver" data-tip-zh="横截面因子综合（价值/质量/低波…）— 轻量质量打破平局，非主导">{{ t('factor', '因子') }}</th>
            <th class="r" data-tip-en="Entry-context blend (0.7·alpha-z + cycle/reversal timing). The board is ranked by α, not this — Phase-0 found the blend does not improve forward-return ranking (reports/setup-score-phase0.md)." data-tip-zh="入场情境混合分（0.7·alpha-z + 周期/反转择时）。榜单按 α 排序而非此分 — Phase-0 显示该混合不改善前瞻收益排序。">{{ t('setup', '布局分') }}</th>
          </tr></thead>
