              <td><span class="ts-tk">{{ r.ticker }}</span> <span class="ts-nm">{{ r.name }}</span>{% if r.insider_buyers %} <span class="ts-ins" data-tip-en="{{ r.insider_buyers }} distinct insiders net-bought{% if r.insider_net_mn %} ${{ '%.1f'|format(r.insider_net_mn) }}M{% endif %}{% if r.insider_bps %} (+{{ r.insider_bps }} bps of cap){% endif %} in the last 6 months — a Form-4 CLUSTER confirmer" data-tip-zh="{{ r.insider_buyers }} 名内部人近 6 个月净买入 — Form-4 集群确认">👤 {{ r.insider_buyers }}</span>{% endif %}{% if r.sue_z %} <span class="ts-sue" data-tip-en="Earnings momentum: SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(r.sue_z) }} vs the S&P 1500 — the latest quarter beat its year-ago seasonal expectation and tends to keep drifting (post-earnings-announcement drift). Standout on the shallow recent window but its cross-sectional edge does NOT persist on deep history; a DISPLAY confirmer, never part of the setup score" data-tip-zh="盈利动量：SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(r.sue_z) }}（相对标普1500）— 在浅窗口曾突出，但其横截面优势在深度历史中不再成立；仅为展示确认项，不计入布局分">📈 {{ t('earnings beat', '盈利超预期') }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="muted">{{ td(r.sector) }}</td>
              <td class="r {{ 'az-up' if r.alpha and r.alpha > 0 else 'az-dn' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.alpha) }}</td>
